:: MP NPC Lin Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.lin>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1 }>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.lin>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Domus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Domus Street">><</if>>
<<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 "a" "m" "m">><<person1>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>街角路灯下，林恩正缠着手腕护具。一见到你，他冷峻的眉眼瞬间柔和，顺手把热乎的烤红薯塞进你怀里：「夜里凉，吃完我送你。」<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 6>>宅邸街岗棚旁，林恩冲你点点头，指了指长椅上的保温壶：「刚巡完前半夜，过来喝口热姜汤。」<<else>>夜雾笼罩着宅邸街与孤儿院外墙。扎高马尾的林恩手按短棍立在灯影下，目光锐利地看向你：「这么晚还在街上，要学防身，还是有事找我？」<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨水顺着岗棚铁檐淌下，林恩的皮靴纤尘不染。<<else>>夜风掠过青石板路，远处传来孤儿院的熄灯铃。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[向林恩道别离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[在岗棚下聊夜巡见闻 (0:06)|MP NPC Lin Chat]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[请他指点防身格斗步法 (0:08)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[陪他巡查孤儿院外巷 (0:16)|MP NPC Lin Help]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_npc.stage or 0) lt 10 and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcQuest_lin)>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[追查地下铁笼的旧账 (0:20)|MP NPC Lin Quest]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcQuest_lin to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

