:: MP NPC Monet Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1 }>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Connudatus Street">><</if>>
<<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 "a" "f" "f">><<person1>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>画室里浮着松节油与白麝香的气息。莫奈放下调色刀，笑着揽过你的肩膀，用温热软布替你擦净衣角：「我的缪斯来了，快坐。」<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 6>>天鹅绒帷幔半掩着露台。莫奈朝你举了举手里的骨瓷咖啡杯：「刚调好一幅海雾蓝，正缺你帮我参详。」<<else>>康努达图斯街阁楼画室挂满油画与丝绸披肩。莫奈夹着画笔打量你的身形轮廓：「来修补衣物，还是愿意做会儿模特？」<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨丝斜织在落地窗外，画布上的色彩愈发深邃。<<else>>夕照透过彩色玻璃，在波斯地毯上洒满暖金斑驳。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[下楼离开阁楼画室 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[坐在软榻边聊画作光影 (0:06)|MP NPC Monet Chat]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[请她修补身上破损衣物 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Service]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[帮她绷紧亚麻画布框 (0:16)|MP NPC Monet Help]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_npc.stage or 0) lt 10 and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcQuest_monet)>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[询问那幅蒙尘署名画 (0:20)|MP NPC Monet Quest]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcQuest_monet to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

