<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcChat_monet>><<set $daily.mpNpcChat_monet to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>你靠在天鹅绒软垫上，看莫奈用炭笔勾勒你的侧影。她眼神专注而炽热，时不时俯身轻触你的下颌调整角度。<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6>>莫奈与你聊起近期多瑙河街沙龙的审美风向，还教你如何用一枚胸针巧妙遮住衣领破口。<<else>>莫奈边洗画笔边与你闲谈，语调慵懒却句句透着对人心的敏锐洞察。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到莫奈身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[俯身替她挽起垂落长发 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Flirt]]>><<pass 4>><<arousal 300>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ((_npc.love or 0) gte 15 or (_npc.lust or 0) gte 12) and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcIntimate_monet)>>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[随她步入丝绒内室写生 (0:25)|MP NPC Monet Intimate]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcIntimate_monet to 1>><<pass 25>><<arousal 1200>><<stress -10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 8 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪她去峭壁露台速写 (0:08)|MP Extra Daily Monet 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>

