:: MP NPC Monet Quest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1 }>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 0)>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	试衣沙龙后台的红木账柜里锁着『V-14』号藏品的交割清单。莫奈借口挑选披肩替你挡住管事视线，让你趁机拓下清单印鉴。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回莫奈身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[用软蜡迅速拓下清单印鉴 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[默记买受人缩写与暗库柜号 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[用软蜡迅速拓下清单印鉴 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[默记买受人缩写与暗库柜号 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	为了模仿古画边缘的岁月氧化层，必须在胡桃木烘箱旁精准控制松烟熏染的火候。莫奈递给你羽毛扇与测温铜片。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[先退回莫奈身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>
		<<link [[轻摇羽扇控制松烟熏染度 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[调配茶水旧化画布背面 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[轻摇羽扇控制松烟熏染度 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[调配茶水旧化画布背面 (0:08)|MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 8>>
	拍卖暗厅后台的十四号紫檀画框背面悬着三枚防盗铜铃。必须在执事巡廊的十秒空档内塞入棉花止音并换入临摹卷。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[先退回莫奈身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 270 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>>
		<<link [[塞入丝绵止住铜铃换下真迹 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Pass]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[顺着画框滑槽无声抽换画芯 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Pass]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[塞入丝绵止住铜铃换下真迹 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Fail]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[顺着画框滑槽无声抽换画芯 (0:10)|MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Fail]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 0>>莫奈掀开画室角落的白布，露出一幅被刮去署名的旧肖像：「这是我老师失踪前的绝笔，真迹底稿被沙龙拍卖行霸占了。」
	<<elseif _stg is 1>>你们用松节油轻轻洗去画角后补的假漆，露出一行用群青颜料写的拍卖行暗库编号『V-14』。
	<<elseif _stg is 3>>回到画室，莫奈根据清单复原了当年被拆卖的三联画右翼草图，查出主画正准备在下周暗拍会上易手。
	<<elseif _stg is 4>>莫奈教你调配出与百年前完全一致的亚麻籽裂纹清漆，准备了一幅足以乱真的临摹替换卷。
	<<elseif _stg is 6>>你们从装裱匠口中得知，拍卖暗厅的画框背面都嵌着防盗铜铃，唯有先取下配重铅坠才能无声换画。
	<<elseif _stg is 7>>莫奈在沙龙晚宴上弹奏钢琴吸引全场宾客目光，掩护你溜进后台 corridors 接近十四号展柜。
	<<elseif _stg is 9>>真迹终于重回阁楼画室。莫奈在晨光中补全了老师的署名，转身将你拥入满是松节油香气的怀抱。
	<<else>>莫奈将整套旧物妥善收好，给你倒了一杯热饮。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_" + _npc.stage)>>
		<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold">莫奈将一份 £15 补贴塞进你掌心。</span><<else>><<money 800>><<stress -2>><span class="gold">莫奈分给你 £8 补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收好东西回到莫奈身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[与莫奈核对下一步去向 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.stage to 3>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
你指尖轻巧地翻开夹层，用蜂蜡片印下火漆纹样并抄出柜号，在管事回头前从容合上柜门。<span class="green">交割清单的柜号与印鉴已完整到手。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_3")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold">莫奈把 £15 分红塞进你口袋。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[随莫奈返回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[整理刚找到的线索物 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 3 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
丝绸屏风被穿堂风吹晃，管事突然转身查看账柜。你连忙缩手退回莫奈身旁，软蜡片被手心汗水捏变了形。<span class="red">管事提前回头，软蜡印模未能成型。</span>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[随莫奈退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[包扎擦伤平复呼吸 (0:05)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.stage to 6>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
你把松烟温度控得分毫不差，亚麻画布表面渐渐浮起一层温润自然的百年琥珀色包浆，连莫奈都惊叹不已。<span class="green">替换画卷的包浆纹路足以乱真。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_6")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold">莫奈把 £15 分红塞进你口袋。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[随莫奈返回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[整理刚找到的线索物 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 6 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
松香炭块突然爆出一团浓烟，画布边角熏黑了一块，刺鼻烟气呛得你连连咳嗽。莫奈连忙拉开窗户散烟，只能重裁一块画布。<span class="red">松烟过浓熏黑画角，只得重裁画布。</span>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[随莫奈退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[包扎擦伤平复呼吸 (0:05)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>><<set _npc.stage to 9>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
你屏息用三团丝绵塞住铃舌，双手稳稳抽出真迹卷入画筒，再将临摹卷推入卡槽，全程未发出一丝声响。<span class="green">真迹画芯在无声无息间物归原主。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_monet_9")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold">莫奈把 £15 分红塞进你口袋。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[随莫奈返回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[整理刚找到的线索物 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Quest 9 Fail [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
你的袖口擦过画框底边的暗弦，铜铃发出一声轻颤。走廊外执事立刻喝问，你慌忙合上展布从侧门退回前厅。<span class="red">暗弦惊动走廊执事，换画行动被迫中止。</span>
<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[随莫奈退回安全处 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[包扎擦伤平复呼吸 (0:05)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 5>><<pain -1>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Monet Street Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.monet>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet to 1>>
你在海风咖啡馆露台偶遇正在速写的莫奈。她撕下一页画着你侧影的速写纸折好塞进你口袋。<span class="green">这份小礼物让你嘴角上扬。</span>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[向莫奈致意后继续赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "Connudatus Street")]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<stress -2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[停步随莫奈坐坐 (0:04)|MP NPC Monet Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1 }>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Forest")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>><<set _exitPas to "Forest">><</if>>
<<endevent>><<generateNPC 1 "a" "m" "m">><<person1>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>篝火噼啪作响。阿什一听见你踩碎落叶的脚步，便起身将烘暖的鹿皮斗篷裹在你身上，粗糙指腹擦过你的脸颊：「林子雾重，过来坐。」<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 6>>古石径旁的木桩上放着一罐热姜汤。阿什收起猎弓朝你招手：「刚巡完北坡，给你留了热的。」<<else>>深林雾气在冷杉间流转。披着灰绿斗篷的阿什正蹲在溪边磨骨刀，抬头静静看向你：「迷路了，还是想找向导？」<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>林雨打在冷杉枝叶上，阿什搭起的油布棚下干爽温暖。<<else>>松脂清香混着泥土气息，林冠间漏下斑驳天光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺着石径离开林间 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[坐在篝火旁聊山林旧事 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Chat]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -4>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[请他带你认林间安全兽径 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Service]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[帮他劈柴并晾晒草药 (0:16)|MP NPC Ash Help]]>><<pass 16>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -3>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_npc.stage or 0) lt 10 and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcQuest_ash)>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[探寻古祭坛的断碑铭文 (0:20)|MP NPC Ash Quest]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcQuest_ash to 1>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Chat [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcChat_ash>><<set $daily.mpNpcChat_ash to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 18>>你依偎在阿什身旁看火苗跳跃。他用骨刀雕出一只小木鹿塞进你掌心，低沉嗓音里满是温和。<<elseif (_npc.love or 0) gte 6>>阿什指着树皮上的青苔厚薄，教你如何在大雾天分辨南北与沼泽边界。<<else>>阿什话不多，但每当你提起林中异动，他都会认真记下并提醒你避开险处。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到阿什身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[靠近火堆依偎他肩头 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Flirt]]>><<pass 4>><<arousal 300>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ((_npc.love or 0) gte 15 or (_npc.lust or 0) gte 12) and (!$daily or !$daily.mpNpcIntimate_ash)>>
	<<mphearticon>><<link [[随他进树屋软榻避寒 (0:25)|MP NPC Ash Intimate]]>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<set $daily.mpNpcIntimate_ash to 1>><<pass 25>><<arousal 1200>><<stress -10>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_npc.love or 0) gte 8 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[陪他去溪流下游收鱼篓 (0:08)|MP Extra Daily Ash 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Service [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcSrv_ash>><<set $daily.mpNpcSrv_ash to 1>><<tending 2>><<tiredness -3>><<stress -5>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>>阿什带你走过一段隐秘的树根高地，教你用松针掩去气味。你在山林里的步伐愈发轻巧。<span class="green">你熟悉了深林避险的法门。</span><<else>>阿什替你绑紧松脱的靴带，递给你一截驱虫艾草。<span class="teal">你在林间行走安心了许多。</span><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回阿什身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="srv-sub-ash">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拉弓试射远处的枯木靶 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#srv-sub-ash">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>羽箭稳稳钉入枯木靶心。<span class="green">阿什眼中闪过一抹赞赏。</span><<stress -2>><<else>>弓弦擦过小臂，箭矢偏入灌木。<span class="red">阿什替你绑好护臂皮套。</span><<stress 2>><</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP NPC Ash Help [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _helpPaid to 0>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcHelp_ash>>
	<<set $daily.mpNpcHelp_ash to 1>><<set _helpPaid to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<money 1200>><<else>><<money 800>><</if>>
<</if>>
<<if _helpPaid>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>你帮阿什劈好整垛松木，还把采回的药根按干湿分装入篓。<span class="green">阿什将 £12 巡林补贴塞进你口袋。</span><<stress -3>><<else>>湿柴滑手磕破了指节，阿什接过斧头让你歇着。<span class="teal">他替你包扎手指，仍分了你 £8 补贴。</span><<stress 2>><</if>>
<<else>>你帮阿什往篝火里添了把干松球。<span class="teal">松香四溢，他递给你一颗烤栗子。</span><<stress -1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[擦净双手回到阿什身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[在火堆旁翻转烘烤药根 (0:06)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Flirt [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcFlirt_ash>><<set $daily.mpNpcFlirt_ash to 1>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.min(100, (_npc.lust or 0) + 2)>><</if>>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>你挨着阿什坐下，把微凉的手探进他斗篷内侧取暖。他身体微僵，随即用宽大手掌将你的手连人一起拢进怀里：「手这么凉，我给你捂着。」<span class="green">他胸膛的温度滚烫而可靠。</span><<stress -3>><<else>>你替阿什摘掉发间沾着的松针。他耳廓微红，低头往火堆里又添了一块柴。<span class="teal">篝火映得他神色柔和。</span><<stress -1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[敛起笑意退回阿什面前 (0:02)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[继续与阿什低声交谈 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Chat]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Intimate [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cabin">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.lust to Math.max(0, (_npc.lust or 0) - 3)>>
高耸古橡树冠上的木屋温暖静谧。阿什将你裹在厚实的狼皮毯里，低头吻去你眉睫上的雾水，结实的手臂整夜未曾松开。<span class="green">山林夜风再也吹不进你心里。</span><<stress -12>><<tiredness -4>><<trauma -4>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[整理衣衫回到阿什身旁 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1 }>><</if>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.hasMet to 1>><<set _stg to (_npc.stage or 0)>>
<<if _stg is 2>>
	暗河谷底的旋涡潭里沉着最关键的一块碑角，潭边石壁长满滑腻水藻，水下暗流湍急。阿什将麻绳系在腰间，让你拉稳绳索或潜入浅滩摸石。
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[先退回阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11600 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 8>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[屏息潜入浅潭摸索碑角 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[绕古树桩拉紧安全麻绳 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<investigateicon>><<link [[屏息潜入浅潭摸索碑角 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[绕古树桩拉紧安全麻绳 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 5>>
	古根地穴入口弥漫着令人头晕的腐叶瘴气，必须先用艾草与松脂调成辟瘴熏香点亮四个通风石孔，才能安全深入。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[先退回阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 450 or (_npc.love or 0) gte 10>>
		<<link [[辨清风向点亮四处辟瘴孔 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[调配浓薄荷水浸湿面巾 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Pass]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[辨清风向点亮四处辟瘴孔 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[调配浓薄荷水浸湿面巾 (0:08)|MP NPC Ash Quest 6 Fail]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _stg is 8>>
	在最后一道泉眼引水槽合拢前，受惊的林间野猪群冲向石环营地。阿什举弓拦在正面，喊你敲响青铜号角并燃起火把驱散兽群。
	<br><br>
	<<link [[先退回阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($willpower or 0) gte 480 or (_npc.trust or 0) gte 12>>
		<<link [[挥动松明火把吹响铜号角 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Pass]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[拉起荆棘拒马封住东侧豁口 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Pass]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[挥动松明火把吹响铜号角 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Fail]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[拉起荆棘拒马封住东侧豁口 (0:10)|MP NPC Ash Quest 9 Fail]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.stage to Math.min(10, _stg + 1)>><<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	<<if _stg is 0>>阿什拨开石环北侧的藤蔓，露出一截断裂的古德鲁伊石碑：「碑文下半截在五十年前山洪里冲进了暗河谷，我想把它找回来。」
	<<elseif _stg is 1>>你们顺着干涸的古河床向下游搜寻，在乱石滩的泥沙里挖出半块刻着星辰轨迹的青石残片。
	<<elseif _stg is 3>>回到营地，阿什用木炭纸将两块残碑拓印拼合，读出碑文记载着古根地穴深处一处镇压林雾的泉眼。
	<<elseif _stg is 4>>阿什用蜂蜡与白树胶调成古法修石膏，与你一起将断裂的石碑重新粘合固定在祭坛基座上。
	<<elseif _stg is 6>>石碑复位后，月泉底部的暗渠仍被百年前坍塌的巨石堵住一半，需要用热胀冷缩之法裂开巨石。
	<<elseif _stg is 7>>你们在巨石四周架起干燥松木烧透石面，再引月泉冷水激淋，随着一声闷响，堵死泉眼的巨石应声裂开。
	<<elseif _stg is 9>>清冽的活水重新注满古石环的水道，林间瘴雾尽数散去。阿什在澄澈月光下将一枚古青铜护身符系在你颈间。
	<<else>>阿什将整套旧物妥善收好，给你倒了一杯热饮。<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_ash_" + _npc.stage)>>
		<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<money 1500>><<stress -4>><span class="gold">阿什将一份 £15 补贴塞进你掌心。</span><<else>><<money 800>><<stress -2>><span class="gold">阿什分给你 £8 补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<else>><<stress -2>><</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[收好东西回到阿什身旁 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[与阿什核对下一步去向 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP NPC Ash Quest 3 Pass [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<set _npc to $mpNpcs.ash>><<set _npc.stage to 3>>
<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
你顶着冰凉的潭水摸到刻满螺旋符文的青石角，用绳套牢牢捆紧，与阿什合力将它拖上了岸。<span class="green">缺失的古碑残角终于重见天日。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("npc_quest_ash_3")>>
	<<money 1500>><span class="gold">阿什把 £15 分红塞进你口袋。</span>
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[随阿什返回落脚处 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[整理刚找到的线索物 (0:03)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 3>><<stress -2>><</link>>

