:: MP NPC Ash Street Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.ash>><<set $mpNpcs.ash to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1 }>><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs.ash.hasMet to 1>>
你在神殿后山石径偶遇下山送药材的阿什。他塞给你一小瓶封好的野蜂巢蜜。<span class="green">清甜蜂蜜让你倦意顿消。</span>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[向阿什致意后继续赶路 (0:02)|($mpReturnPassage or "Forest")]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<stress -2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[停步随阿什坐坐 (0:04)|MP NPC Ash Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -4>><</link>>
